 "grammar": {
  "title": {
   "ko": "교육 어휘 · 학습 방법 · 가정법 · 장기 계획",
   "en": "education vocabulary · learning methods · hypotheticals · long-term plans"
  },
  "explain": {
   "ko": "교육과 학습에 관한 글에서는 학습의 목적, 방법, 효과를 다룹니다. 어휘는 curriculum, qualification, scholarship, assessment, motivation, lifelong learning입니다. 현재 하고 있는 공부는 현재진행형(I am learning French)으로, 오랫동안 이어진 학습은 현재완료진행형(I have been learning for two years)으로 말합니다. 하고 싶은 일은 가정법(If I had more time, I would …)으로 표현합니다. 미래의 목표는 within, by, in five years 같은 시간 표현과 함께 말하면 구체적입니다.",
   "en": "Texts on education cover the purpose, methods and effects of learning. Vocabulary: curriculum, qualification, scholarship, assessment, motivation, lifelong learning. Use the present continuous for current study (I am learning French) and the present perfect continuous for long study (I have been learning for two years). Express wishes with hypotheticals (If I had more time, I would …). Name goals with time phrases such as within, by, in five years."
  },
  "table": {
   "head": [
    "기능 / Function",
    "표현 / Phrase",
    "예문 / Example"
   ],
   "rows": [
    [
     "현재 학습 / current",
     "am + -ing",
     "I am learning French."
    ],
    [
     "지속 / continuing",
     "have been + -ing",
     "I have been studying for two years."
    ],
    [
     "가정 / hypothesis",
     "If + past, would + verb",
     "If I had time, I would study more."
    ],
    [
     "목표 / goal",
     "within · by · in + time",
     "within five years"
    ]
   ]
  },
  "notes": [
   {
    "ko": "study는 학업, learn은 습득을 뜻합니다.",
    "en": "Study = work at learning; learn = acquire."
   },
